# Pipeline outputs are not tracked, with one deliberate exception: the small files
# scripts/build_docs_figures.py reads its numbers from. Tracking those is what lets the
# docs CI regenerate every figure from the same sources on a bare checkout, instead of
# skipping them and publishing whatever SVG was last committed from a local run.
#
# `results/*` rather than `results/`: git does not descend into an ignored DIRECTORY, so
# a negation for a file inside one never fires. Each exception below therefore un-ignores
# the directory, re-ignores its contents, then names the file.
results/*
!results/glint_observability_by_quadrat.csv
!results/glint_observability_summary.json
!results/glint_pose_by_region.csv
!results/glint_pose_by_region_combined.csv
!results/pakistan_glint_pose_regional.html
!results/pakistan_pv_estimator_atlas.html
!results/pakistan_pv_density_scientific.png
!results/glint_date_feature/
results/glint_date_feature/*
!results/glint_date_feature/standalone_auc.csv
!results/glint_date_feature/incremental_auc.csv
!results/glint_validation_pakistan/
results/glint_validation_pakistan/*
!results/glint_validation_pakistan/pakistan_stats_by_size.csv
!results/glint_validation_pakistan/pv_pose_country2000.html
!data/labels/calibration_boundaries/*
!results/calibration_quadrats_validation.geojson
!results/pakistan_pv_reference_comparison.html
!results/pakistan_pv_external_comparison.html

# Generated reports kept in the repo on request, as a durable artifact rather than a
# figure-script input -- regenerate with scripts/pv_reference_share_comparison.py.
!results/pakistan_pv_reference_comparison.html

# The random-cell manual-validation record (docs/methods/roofclf-national-validation.md)
# is the only durable evidence that a national roofclf scoring pass was actually reviewed
# against an unbiased sample -- it must be tracked, not silently dropped by `results/*`.
!results/roofclf_random_validation_log.csv
!results/pakistan_roofclf_parcel_validation/
results/pakistan_roofclf_parcel_validation/*
!results/pakistan_roofclf_parcel_validation/*.geojson
!results/pakistan_roofclf_parcel_validation/*.mapcss
